<title>USA: Gore not planning to change trip schedule.</title>
<headline>Gore not planning to change trip schedule.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vice President Al Gore had no plans on Friday to return early to Washington from California in the wake of President Bill Clinton's leg injury, Gore's office said.</p>
<p>A spokesman said Gore would return as scheduled on Friday evening.</p>
